Third-party data
================
  - suggest/src/main/assets/dict/en.dict.gz, pt.dict.gz
      Generated by tools/gen_dict.py from the AOSP LatinIME wordlists
      (dictionaries/en_US_wordlist.combined.gz, pt_BR_wordlist.combined.gz).
      Copyright The Android Open Source Project. Apache License 2.0.
  - emoji/src/main/assets/fonts/NotoColorEmoji.ttf
      Noto Color Emoji 2.051, COLRv1 build (fonts/Noto-COLRv1.ttf),
      https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji. Copyright 2013 Google LLC.
      SIL Open Font License 1.1; the full text is in
      licenses/OFL-1.1-Noto-Emoji.txt. Unmodified.
  - suggest/src/main/assets/ngram/en.ngram.gz, pt.ngram.gz
      Next-word counts generated by tools/gen_ngrams.py from the Tatoeba
      sentence collection (https://tatoeba.org), English and Portuguese
      exports. Licensed CC BY 2.0 FR
      (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/fr/); changed: only
      word-sequence counts are kept, no sentence is included.
  - suggest/src/main/assets/dict/en.chat, pt.chat
      Chat words and abbreviations, written for KeyHack. Apache License 2.0.
  - emoji/src/main/assets/emoji.tsv
      Generated by tools/gen_emoji.py from Unicode emoji-test.txt and the
      Unicode CLDR annotations (cldr-json).
      Copyright (c) 1991-2026 Unicode, Inc. Unicode License V3; the full
      notice is in licenses/Unicode-License-V3.txt.

